 (50,'Calpis Yogurt Strawberry','Dessert',6.5,13,1,'/project/uploads/menu_6a0c0c7e6f13f8.37018158.jpg','',0.0,0,'Wed,Thu'),
 (51,'Oreo Double Stuff New York Cheesecake','Dessert',9.9,22,1,'/project/uploads/menu_6a0c0caa5ce2d7.80165432.webp','Rich and creamy dessert that combines smooth New York-style cheesecake with crushed Oreo cookies and extra creamy Oreo filling. It has a thick, velvety texture, a buttery cookie crust, and a sweet cookies-and-cream flavor in every bite.',0.0,0,NULL),
 (52,'Baked Churro','Dessert',8.0,29,1,'/project/uploads/menu_6a0da9c4f3ec11.37994873.png','Freshly made churros with a crispy outside and soft inside, coated in cinnamon sugar and served warm. Perfect for a sweet snack anytime.',0.0,0,'Thu'),
 (53,'Jjamppong Noodles','Noodles',9.0,25,1,'/project/uploads/menu_6a0db017ae8d40.05117660.png','Spicy Korean seafood noodle soup made with a rich red broth, loaded with ingredients like squid, shrimp, mussels, vegetables, and chewy noodles. It has a deep, smoky heat and a bold umami flavor, often served piping hot.',0.0,0,NULL),
 (54,'Ramen','Noodles',9.0,14,1,'/project/uploads/menu_6a0db215ab1c78.77573780.png','Japanese-style noodle dish made with wheat noodles served in a flavorful broth, such as chicken or beef stock. It’s topped with ingredients like sliced chicken, boiled egg, seaweed, and fresh vegetables, offering a rich and comforting bowl.',0.0,0,NULL),
 (55,'Pho','Noodles',8.0,19,1,'/project/uploads/menu_6a0db352aadad4.27365290.png','Traditional Vietnamese noodle soup made with a fragrant, slow-simmered broth, rice noodles, and fresh herbs. It is typically served with slices of beef or chicken, and accompanied by garnishes like bean sprouts, lime, chili, and basil for added flavor and freshness.',0.0,0,NULL),
 (56,'Spaghetti Bolognese','Noodles',7.0,20,1,'/project/uploads/menu_6a0db426d21060.84387159.png','Italian-inspired pasta dish made with spaghetti noodles topped with a rich, slow-cooked meat sauce. The sauce is usually made from minced beef, tomatoes, onions, garlic, and herbs, creating a hearty and flavorful meal that’s both comforting and filling.',0.0,0,NULL),
 (57,'Chili Pan Mee','Noodles',7.5,15,1,'/project/uploads/menu_6a0db4f202bc63.37237559.png','Malaysian noodle dish made with springy handmade noodles, served with minced meat, crispy anchovies, fried shallots, a soft-boiled egg, and a spicy chili paste. It’s mixed together before eating, creating a bold, savory, and spicy flavor with a satisfying mix of textures.',0.0,0,NULL),
 (58,'Pad Thai','Noodles',8.0,25,1,'/project/uploads/menu_6a0db5e55e0c73.28621014.png','Popular Thai street food dish made with stir-fried rice noodles tossed in a tangy sweet-sour sauce. It’s usually cooked with eggs, bean sprouts, chives, and topped with crushed peanuts, and can include prawns, chicken, or tofu for extra flavor.',0.0,0,NULL),
 (59,'Bibimbap','Rice',7.5,20,1,'/project/uploads/menu_6a0db726226c86.37234693.png','Traditional Korean rice dish served with a colorful mix of seasoned vegetables, sliced meat, and a fried or raw egg placed on top of warm rice. It is usually finished with gochujang, a spicy red chili paste, which is mixed thoroughly with all the ingredients before eating. The dish offers a balance of textures and flavors, combining savory, slightly sweet, and spicy notes in every bite.',0.0,0,NULL),
 (60,'Kunafa','Dessert',8.9,30,1,'/project/uploads/menu_6a0db8b21968d2.79988777.png','Middle Eastern dessert made with thin, shredded pastry layered or wrapped around a soft cheese or cream filling, then baked until golden and crispy. It is soaked in a sweet sugar syrup, often flavored with rose or orange blossom water, giving it a rich, sweet, and fragrant taste.',0.0,0,'Tue'),
 (61,'Roti Jala (5 Pcs)','Side Dishes',5.0,14,1,'/project/uploads/menu_6a0e40e8854740.26357708.jpg','',0.0,0,'Tue,Sat');
